2026-10-31T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2381) 'A Rust guest linked against static glibc failed on the Windows host, translated and interpreted alike, and so did the released addon. The first three fixes left the crash in place.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2381  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2381) 'Check that the Windows host answers `brk`, `clock_gettime`, error numbers and `sched_getaffinity` as the Linux host does.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2381  1 LINE
 Text:Written

